# Text files are LF in every working tree, on every platform.
#
# The bundle carries source text verbatim, and its version has to identify
# its bytes. With core.autocrlf on Windows, the same commit built to
# different files there and in CI - 0.1.0+6ff17b0 hashed 2865cc3d... on
# Windows and 7e056132... on Linux. With this rule both give 7e056132...
* text=auto eol=lf
